{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229420/extras/71b5346d97fcff0c4a3ac89dfb29f875.avif?t=1771870967\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three heroes. One stolen artifact. A journey through steel and secrets, with something ancient stirring beneath it all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Danger World</i> is a handcrafted, turn-based RPG that blends classic adventure vibes with snappy combat and a story full of choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLLOW THREE ADVENTURERS ON A HIGH-STAKES QUEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When their town\u2019s sacred jewel vanishes, Belle, Amelia, and Wren set out to track the thieves and stumble upon more than they bargained for. From sunlit forests to smoking foundries, they\u2019ll battle corrupted machines and unravel long-buried mysteries.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229420/extras/69065305f9a6e04e0962600ecbf03512.avif?t=1771870967\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT SMART, STRIKE HARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Danger World</i> is turn-based and built for momentum. Every hero has a distinct style and role:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belle</strong> takes the hits and brings down the hammer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amelia</strong> darts in with blades and finishes what others start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wren</strong> hits wide and hard with his greatsword.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No skill trees. No stat juggling. Just tight, purposeful encounters where your timing and decisions matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From riverside towns to ancient ruins, every stop on your journey brings choices and consequences. Do you help the villagers or keep chasing the trail? Do you explore the detour or press forward toward the threat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your route changes how the story unfolds and what you bring to the final battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229420/extras/415f5dc295c86943c30103abda1a7d9a.poster.avif?t=1771870967\" width=616 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229420/extras/415f5dc295c86943c30103abda1a7d9a.webm?t=1771870967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229420/extras/415f5dc295c86943c30103abda1a7d9a.mp4?t=1771870967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A WORLD ON THE EDGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark army is tearing through the land, awakening forces meant to stay buried. Your trio might be the last defense against what\u2019s coming, but only if you can stay ahead of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO GRIND. JUST ADVENTURE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is crafted, not random. Each move pushes the story forward. You\u2019ll face enemies that hit hard, force choices, and don\u2019t waste your time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE THE ROAD LESS TRAVELED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own path through Danger World. Routes branch, choices ripple, and who you save (or don\u2019t) might echo later.<br><br><strong>This is <i>Danger World</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared